\"\" style=\"letter-spacing: 1px;\">&rdquo;话音未落，开发组长已皱眉打断：&ldquo;到底要还是不要？</span><span data-pm-slice=\"1 1 [&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;p&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;margin-bottom: 40px;line-height: 1.75em;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;}]\" leaf=\"\" style=\"letter-spacing: 1px;\">&rdquo;</span></p>\r\n\t<p style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);letter-spacing:0.544px;line-height:1.75em;margin-bottom:16px;font-size:17px;text-indent:2.11765em;\">\r\n\t\t<span leaf=\"\" style=\"letter-spacing: 1px;\">这个场</span><span mpa-font-style=\"m9l2lo4rnwv\"><span data-mpa-action-id=\"m9l2lo4ri1c\" leaf=\"\" style=\"letter-spacing: 1px;\">景告诉我们一个扎心的现实：</span><span data-mpa-action-id=\"m9l2krkkkm9\" leaf=\"\" style=\"letter-spacing: 1px; font-weight: bold;\">项目管理岗比的不是技术，而是领导力</span><span data-mpa-action-id=\"m9l2lo4rbcr\" leaf=\"\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 1px; font-weight: bold;\" textstyle=\"\">。</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 1px;\" textstyle=\"\">弱者气息就像隐藏bug，会在关键时刻让整个系统崩溃。</span></span></span></p>\r\n\t<p>\r\n\t\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n</section>\r\n<section class=\"_editor\" data-style-id=\"75340\" data-support=\"96编辑器\" style=\"margin-bottom:unset;\">\r\n\t<section style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:row;align-items:center;margin-bottom:12px;\">\r\n\t\t<section style=\"border: 2px solid rgb(245, 205, 19); border-radius: 20px; padding: 1px 15px; margin-right: -18px; box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: unset; transform: rotateZ(0deg);\">\r\n\t\t\t<p style=\"color:#3399ff;line-height:1.75;text-align:center;font-size:18px;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<strong>01</strong></p>\r\n\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t<section style=\"background-color:rgb(51, 153, 255);padding:8px 28px;border-radius:4px 16px 16px 4px;box-sizing:border-box;margin-bottom:unset;\">\r\n\t\t\t<p style=\"color:#ffffff;line-height:1.75;letter-spacing:0px;text-align:center;font-size:18px;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<strong>什么是强者气息？</strong></p>\r\n\