clear:both;min-height:1em;line-height:1.75em;letter-spacing:0.5px;color:#cb523e;caret-color:#ff0000;font-weight:bold;display:inline !important;\">&ldquo;强者气息&rdquo;指的就是领导力</span><span data-mpa-action-id=\"m9kzbgokju\" data-pm-slice=\"1 1 [&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;p&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 32px; line-height: 1.75em;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;}]\" leaf=\"\" style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color:#00000000;letter-spacing:0.5px;\">。说到领导力其实就很好理解了，小赛用通俗的话来解释一下</span><span data-mpa-action-id=\"m9kzbgokju\" data-pm-slice=\"1 1 [&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;p&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 32px; line-height: 1.75em;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;}]\" leaf=\"\" style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color:#00000000;letter-spacing:0.5px;\">领导力：</span></p>\r\n\t\t\t<blockquote style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color:#00000000;padding-right:0px;padding-bottom:0px;color:#0000008c;letter-spacing:0.544px;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<p style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color:#00000000;margin-bottom:16px;font-size:17px;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<span style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);\">领导力是一个人能够带动和影响周围的人，一起朝着共同的目标努力，并在这个过程中激发大家的积极性和创造力，让事情/结果变得更好的能力。</span></p>\r\n\t\t\t</blockquote>\r\n\t\t\t<p style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color:transparent;margin-top:32px;letter-spacing:0.544px;line-height:1.75em;margin-bottom:16px;font-size:17px;text-indent:2.11765em;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<span style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; letter-spacing: 0.51px;\"><span leaf=\"\" style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">再简单点来说，就是能够</span><span style=\"color: rgb(203, 82, 62); caret-color: rgb(255, 0, 0); clear: both; min-height: 1em; line-height: 1.75em; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; letter-spacing: 0.51px; font-weight: bold;\">&ldquo;带队伍&rdquo;、&ldquo;打胜仗&rdquo;</span><span leaf=\"\" style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">的能力。</span></span></p>\r\n\t\t\t<section class=\"_editor\" data-style-id=\"72393\" data-support=\"96编辑器\" style=\"margin-bottom:unset;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<section style=\"display:flex;justify-content:flex-start;align-items:center;border-bottom:2px solid rgb(51, 153, 255);padding-bottom:10px;box-sizing:border-box;margin-bottom:unset;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<section style=\"width:8px;height:18px;background-color:rgb(51, 153, 255);border-radius:4px;margin-right:10px;box-sizing:border-box;margin-bottom:unset;overflow:hidden;line-height:0;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t&nbsp;</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"line-height:1.75;font-size:17px;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<strong>项目经理需要有领导力吗？</strong></p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"margin-left:10px;font-size:12px;color:#999999;margin-top:5px;letter-spacing:0px;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<section style=\"width:2em;margin-left:auto;margin-bottom:-45px;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t<p style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color:transparent;letter-spacing:0.544px;line-height:1.75em;margin-bottom:16px;margin-top:8px;font-size:17px;text-indent:2.11765em;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<span style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; letter-spacing: 0.51px;\"><span leaf=\"\" style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color:transparent;letter-spacing:1px;\">自然，虽然项目经理没有&ldquo;经理&rdquo;的实权，但是</span><strong style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color:transparent;\"><span style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color:transparent;letter-spacing:0.51px;color:#007aaa;\"><span leaf=\"\" style=\"float: none; clear: both; min-height: 1em; color: rgb(203, 82, 62); caret-color: rgb(255, 0, 0); -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; letter-spacing: 1px; display: inline !important;\">带团队、</span><span style=\"color: rgb(203, 82, 62); caret-color: rgb(255, 0, 0); clear: both; min-height: 1em; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; letter-spacing: 1px;\">协调各方资源、解决项目问题</span></span></strong><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.51px; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;\"><span leaf=\"\" style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color:transparent;letter-spacing:1px;\">都需要领导力的加持。</span></span></span></p>\r\n\t\t\t<p style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color:transparent;letter-spacing:0.544px;line-height:1.75em;margin-bottom:16px;font-size:17px;text-indent:2.11765em;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<span style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; letter-spacing: 0.51px;\"><span style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; letter-spacing: 1px;\" textstyle=\"\">那么，项目经理需要具备哪些领导力特质呢？根据领导力三环模型，我们可以了解到项目经理需要履行领导者的八大基本职责：</span><span style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; letter-spacing: 1px; font-weight: bold;\" textstyle=\"\">明确任务、制定计划、指示、控制、评价、提供支持、激励和以身作则</span><span style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; letter-spacing: 1px;\" textstyle=\"\">。</span></span></p>\r\n\t\t\t<section class=\"_editor\" data-style-id=\"72393\" data-support=\"96编辑器\" style=\"margin-bottom:unset;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<section style=\"display:flex;justify-content:flex-start;align-items:center;border-bottom:2px solid rgb(51, 153, 255);padding-bottom:10px;margin-bottom:unset;box-sizing:border-box;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<section style=\"width:8px;height:18px;background-color:rgb(51, 153, 255);border-radius:4px;margin-right:10px;margin-bottom:unset;overflow:hidden;line-height:0;box-sizing:border-box;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t&nbsp;</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"line-height:1.75;font-size:17px;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<strong>领导力的作用有哪些？</strong></p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"margin-left:10px;font-size:12px;color:#999999;margin-top:5px;letter-spacing:0px;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<section style=\"width:2em;margin-left:auto;margin-bottom:-45px;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t<p style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color:#00000000;letter-spacing:0.544px;margin-bottom:16px;margin-top:8px;font-size:17px;text-indent:2em;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<span style=\"letter-spacing: normal; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);\">在观察过身边很多项目负责人后，小赛发现拥有很强领导力的人都有一些共性：</span></p>\r\n\t\t\t<ul class=\"list-paddingleft-2\" style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); padding-right: 0px; font-size: 17px; letter-spacing: 0.544px; text-align: justify; list-style-type: circle;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<li style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color:#00000000;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); margin-bottom: 16px;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<span style=\"color: rgb(136, 136, 136); font-style: italic; letter-spacing: normal; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);\">在信息不全时果断拍板；</span></p>\r\n\t\t\t\t</li>\r\n\t\t\t\t<li style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color:#00000000;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); margin-bottom: 16px;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<span style=\"color: rgb(136, 136, 136); font-style: italic; letter-spacing: normal; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);\">在被质疑时用逻辑而非情绪反击；</span></p>\r\n\t\t\t\t</li>\r\n\t\t\t\t<li style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color:#00000000;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); margin-bottom: 16px;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<span style=\"color: rgb(136, 136, 136); font-style: italic; letter-spacing: normal; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);\">项目工期紧张时还能开玩笑调节团队气氛；</span></p>\r\n\t\t\t\t</li>\r\n\t\t\t\t<li style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color:#00000000;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); margin-bottom: 16px;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<span style=\"color: rgb(136, 136, 136); font-style: italic; letter-spacing: normal; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);\">把&ldquo;踩过的坑&rdquo;变成全组的经验资产。</span></p>\r\n\t\t\t\t</li>\r\n\t\t\t</ul>\r\n\t\t\t<p style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color:#00000000;letter-spacing:0.544px;line-height:1.75em;margin-bottom:16px;font-size:17px;text-indent:2.11765em;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<span style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color:#00000000;margin-top:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-left:0px;letter-spacing:1px;\">再比如，在面对</span><span leaf=\"\" style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color:#00000000;margin-top:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-left:0px;float:none;letter-spacing:1px;font-weight:bold;display:inline !important;\">复杂多变的项目环境和突发情况时</span><span style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color:transparent;margin-top:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-left:0px;\"><span leaf=\"\" style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color:#00000000;margin-top:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-left:0px;letter-spacing:1px;\">，项目经理需要</span><span leaf=\"\" style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color:transparent;margin-top:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-left:0px;float:none;clear:both;min-height:1em;color:#cb523e;caret-color:#ff0000;letter-spacing:1px;font-weight:bold;display:inline !important;\">迅速做决策，并与团队成员沟通</span><span leaf=\"\" style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color:#00000000;margin-top:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-left:0px;letter-spacing:1px;\">，及时解决问题，确保项目的顺利进行，这些都需要项目经理具备强大的领导力来支撑。</span></span></p>\r\n\t\t\t<p style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color:transparent;letter-spacing:0.544px;line-height:1.75em;margin-bottom:16px;font-size:17px;text-indent:2.11765em;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<span style=\"letter-spacing: 1px; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-left: 0px;\">普通项目经理如何培养自己的领导力？其实平常做项目的过程中，就是在不断地锻炼自己。</span></p>\r\n\t\t</section>\r\n\t</section>\r\n\t<section class=\"_li\" style=\"margin-top:15px;margin-bottom:unset;\">\r\n\t\t<section style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:row;align-items:center;margin-bottom:12px;\">\r\n\t\t\t<section style=\"border: 2px solid rgb(245, 205, 19); border-radius: 20px; padding: 1px 15px; margin-right: -18px; box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: unset; transform: rotateZ(0deg);\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<p style=\"color:#3399ff;line-height:1.75;text-align:center;font-size:18px;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<strong>02</strong></p>\r\n\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t<section style=\"background-color:rgb(51, 153, 255);padding:8px 28px;border-radius:4px 16px 16px 4px;box-sizing:border-box;margin-bottom:unset;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<p style=\"color:#ffffff;line-height:1.75;letter-spacing:0px;text-align:center;font-size:18px;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<strong>做项目可以培养领导力</strong></p>\r\n\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t<section style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:row;align-items:flex-start;margin-bottom:unset;\">\r\n\t\t\t<section style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;margin-right:8px;margin-top:15px;margin-bottom:unset;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<section style=\"width:8px;height:8px;border-radius:50%;background-color:rgb(245, 205, 19);margin-bottom:6px;box-sizing:border-box;overflow:hidden;line-height:0;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t&nbsp;</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t<section style=\"width:8px;height:8px;border-radius:50%;background-color:rgb(245, 205, 19);margin-bottom:6px;box-sizing:border-box;overflow:hidden;line-height:0;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t&nbsp;</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t<section style=\"width:8px;height:8px;border-radius:50%;background-color:rgb(245, 205, 19);box-sizing:border-box;margin-bottom:unset;overflow:hidden;line-height:0;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t&nbsp;</section>\r\n\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t<section style=\"flex:1 1 0%;background-color:rgb(223, 238, 253);border-radius:8px;padding:18px 15px;box-sizing:border-box;margin-bottom:unset;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<p style=\"letter-spacing: 0px; line-height: 1.75em; font-size: 17px; text-indent: 2em;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t领导力不是与生俱来的，而是在做项目的过程中一点点积累下来的。在开展项目中，你可以明确感受到以下这些变化：</p>\r\n\t\t\t\t<p style=\"letter-spacing: 0px; line-height: 1.75em;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"_editor\" data-style-id=\"72393\" data-support=\"96编辑器\" style=\"margin-bottom:unset;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<section style=\"display:flex;justify-content:flex-start;align-items:center;border-bottom:2px solid rgb(51, 153, 255);padding-bottom:10px;margin-bottom:unset;box-sizing:border-box;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<section style=\"width:8px;height:18px;background-color:rgb(51, 153, 255);border-radius:4px;margin-right:10px;margin-bottom:unset;overflow:hidden;line-height:0;box-sizing:border-box;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t&nbsp;</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"line-height:1.75;font-size:17px;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<strong>项目在锻造你的商业思维</strong></p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"margin-left:10px;font-size:12px;color:#999999;margin-top:5px;letter-spacing:0px;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<section style=\"width:2em;margin-left:auto;margin-bottom:-45px;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t<p style=\"margin-top:8px;line-height:1.75em;margin-bottom:16px;font-size:17px;text-indent:2.11765em;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<span data-mpa-action-id=\"m9l0fe9m20vn\" leaf=\"\" style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color:#00000000;letter-spacing:0.5px;\">要知道，项目实战是商业思维的最佳训练场。</span><span mpa-font-style=\"m9kzxq2l1kz\" style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);\"><span data-pm-slice=\"1 1 [&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;letter-spacing: 0.578px; margin-top: 32px; margin-bottom: 32px; line-height: 1.75em;&quot;,&quot;data-mpa-action-id&quot;:&quot;m9kzxq2u1z5d&quot;,&quot;data-pm-slice&quot;:&quot;0 0 []&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;},&quot;node&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;span&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;mpa-font-style&quot;:&quot;m9kzxq2l1kz&quot;,&quot;style&quot;:&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;},&quot;node&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;span&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \\&quot;Helvetica Neue\\&quot;, \\&quot;PingFang SC\\&quot;, \\&quot;Hiragino Sans GB\\&quot;, \\&quot;Microsoft YaHei UI\\&quot;, \\&quot;Microsoft YaHei\\&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; float: none; display: inline !important;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;}]\" leaf=\"\" style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color:#00000000;letter-spacing:0.5px;\">从接手项目的第一个小时起，你就需要同时看清</span><span leaf=\"\" style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color:#00000000;letter-spacing:0.5px;\">市场部的增长焦虑、技术部的资源瓶颈、财务部的成本限制。</span></span></p>\r\n\t\t\t\t<p style=\"line-height:1.75em;margin-bottom:16px;font-size:17px;text-indent:2.11765em;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<span style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); letter-spacing: 0.5px;\" textstyle=\"\">在制定项目计划时，你需要从</span><span style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); letter-spacing: 0.5px; font-weight: bold;\" textstyle=\"\">市场需求出发，制定策略、规划资源、评估风险</span><span style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); letter-spacing: 0.5px;\" textstyle=\"\">，每一步都考验着你的商业洞察力和决策能力。</span></span></p>\r\n\t\t\t\t<p style=\"line-height:1.75em;margin-bottom:16px;font-size:17px;text-indent:2.11765em;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<span data-mpa-action-id=\"m9l0fe9m1vnw\" leaf=\"\" style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">通过不断参与项目，积累实战经验，能够让你逐渐学会</span><span data-mpa-action-id=\"m9l0fe9m1vnw\" leaf=\"\" style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; float: none; clear: both; min-height: 1em; line-height: 1.75em; letter-spacing: 0.5px; color: rgb(203, 82, 62); caret-color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-weight: bold; display: inline !important;\">如何从全局角度思考问题，如何在商业环境中找到机会点</span><span data-mpa-action-id=\"m9l0fe9m1vnw\" leaf=\"\" style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">。这种思维方式的转变，正是领导力的重要组成部分。</span></p>\r\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"_editor\" data-style-id=\"72393\" data-support=\"96编辑器\" style=\"margin-bottom:unset;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<section style=\"display:flex;justify-content:flex-start;align-items:center;border-bottom:2px solid rgb(51, 153, 255);padding-bottom:10px;margin-bottom:unset;box-sizing:border-box;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<section style=\"width:8px;height:18px;background-color:rgb(51, 153, 255);border-radius:4px;margin-right:10px;margin-bottom:unset;overflow:hidden;line-height:0;box-sizing:border-box;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t&nbsp;</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"line-height:1.75;font-size:17px;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<strong>项目在磨练你的抗压能力</strong></p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"margin-left:10px;font-size:12px;color:#999999;margin-top:5px;letter-spacing:0px;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<section style=\"width:2em;margin-left:auto;margin-bottom:-45px;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t<p style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color:#00000000;letter-spacing:0.544px;line-height:1.75em;margin-bottom:16px;margin-top:8px;font-size:17px;text-indent:2.11765em;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<span style=\"letter-spacing: normal; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color:#00000000;letter-spacing:0.5px;\" textstyle=\"\">经历过完整项目周期的人都知道，</span><span style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color:#00000000;letter-spacing:0.5px;font-weight:bold;\" textstyle=\"\">真正的战斗往往发生在计划之外</span><span style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color:#00000000;letter-spacing:0.5px;\" textstyle=\"\">：</span><span style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color:#00000000;letter-spacing:0.5px;\" textstyle=\"\">验收前三天核心供应商突然毁约、跨部门协调会上被当面质疑专业度、临到项目收尾资金严重透支等等。</span></span></p>\r\n\t\t\t\t<p style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color:#00000000;letter-spacing:0.544px;line-height:1.75em;margin-bottom:16px;font-size:17px;text-indent:2.11765em;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<span style=\"letter-spacing: normal; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); letter-spacing: 0.5px;\" textstyle=\"\">这时候最能暴露人的真正本领，在面对这些危机时，</span><span style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); letter-spacing: 0.5px;\" textstyle=\"\">身为团队第一负责人&mdash;&mdash;</span><span style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); letter-spacing: 0.5px;\" textstyle=\"\">项目经理要</span><span style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); letter-spacing: 0.5px;\" textstyle=\"\">学会</span><span data-pm-slice=\"1 1 [&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;p&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;margin-bottom: 32px; line-height: 1.75em;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;}]\" leaf=\"\" style=\"float: none; clear: both; min-height: 1em; line-height: 1.75em; color: rgb(203, 82, 62); caret-color: rgb(255, 0, 0); -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-weight: bold; display: inline !important;\">保持冷静，快速调整策略</span><span style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); letter-spacing: 0.5px;\" textstyle=\"\">。项目落地后进行</span><span data-pm-slice=\"1 1 [&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;p&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;margin-bottom: 32px; line-height: 1.75em;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;}]\" leaf=\"\" style=\"float: none; clear: both; min-height: 1em; line-height: 1.75em; color: rgb(203, 82, 62); caret-color: rgb(255, 0, 0); -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-weight: bold; display: inline !important;\">复盘总结</span><span style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); letter-spacing: 0.5px;\" textstyle=\"\">，下次再遇到更大的挑战时也可以从容不迫。</span></span></p>\r\n\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t</section>\r\n\t</section>\r\n</section>\r\n<section class=\"_editor\" style=\"margin-bottom:unset;\">\r\n\t<p>\r\n\t\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n</section>\r\n<section class=\"_editor\" style=\"margin-bottom:unset;\">\r\n\t<p>\r\n\t\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n</section>"}